Our Company
Esquire Financial Holdings, Inc. (“Esquire Financial” or the “Company”) is a financial holding company headquartered in Jericho, New York and registered under the Bank Holding Company Act (“BHCA”) of 1956, as amended (the “BHC Act”). Through our wholly owned bank subsidiary, Esquire Bank, National Association (“Esquire Bank” or the “Bank”), we are a full service commercial bank dedicated to serving the financial needs of the legal and small business communities
